const EXPLAIN_EN = {"标调顺序：有 a 标 a；没有 a，找 o 或 e；i 和 u 在一起，标在后面那个：guì、liù。": "Where the tone mark goes: on a if there is one; otherwise on o or e; when i and u are together, mark the second one: guì, liù.", "j、q、x 后面的 u 其实是 ü：ju = jü，qu = qü，xu = xü。": "After j, q and x, the letter u is really ü (the dots are just dropped): ju = jü, qu = qü, xu = xü.", "n、l 后面要保留两点：nǚ（女）、lǜ（绿）。": "After n and l you must keep the two dots, because nu/lu also exist: nǚ (female), lǜ (green).", "先横后竖：十　·　先撇后捺：人　·　从上到下：三　·　从左到右：你": "Stroke-order rules: horizontal before vertical (十) · left-falling before right-falling (人) · top to bottom (三) · left to right (你).", "全包围的字“先进人，后关门”：国 —— 先写里面的“玉”，最后一横封口。": "For enclosed characters, \"let people in, then close the door\": in 国, write the outer frame, then the inside 玉, and seal it with the bottom stroke last.", "对老师、长辈用“您 nín”，更礼貌。": "Use 您 nín (polite \"you\") for teachers and elders; it is more respectful than 你.", "中文姓名：姓在前，名在后。王小明 = 姓“王” + 名“小明”。": "Chinese names put the surname first and the given name after: 王小明 = surname 王 + given name 小明.", "有“什么”的问句，句末不再加“吗”。": "A question that already has 什么 (what) never takes 吗 at the end — the question word does the job.", "两位数 = 几十几：37 = 三十七，73 = 七十三。": "Two-digit numbers are \"tens + ones\": 37 = 三十七 (three-ten-seven), 73 = 七十三.", "日期由大到小：2026年11月4日，星期三。": "Dates go from big to small: year → month → day → weekday: 2026年11月4日，星期三.", "说年龄不用“是”。": "Don't use 是 with age: say 我今年二十岁, not 我是二十岁.", "电话号码一个数字一个数字读，“1” 读 yāo，免得和 “七 qī” 听混。": "Read phone numbers digit by digit, and say \"1\" as yāo so it isn't confused with 七 qī (7).", "地址由大到小：文莱 → 文莱-摩拉县 → 加东。": "Addresses go from big to small: country → district → area, e.g. Brunei → Brunei-Muara → Gadong.", "“住在 + 地方”。": "The pattern is 住在 + place (\"live at + place\"): 我住在加东.", "“有”的否定永远是“没有”。": "The negative of 有 (have) is always 没有, never 不有.", "“在 + 地方”放在动词前面。": "The place phrase 在 + place comes before the verb: 他在医院工作 (literally \"he at hospital works\").", "“也”是副词，后面要有动词“是”。": "也 (also) is an adverb, so it needs a verb after it: 我妈妈也是老师, not 也老师.", "“也”不能放在句末。": "也 can't go at the end like English \"too\"; it sits before the verb.", "国家 + 人 = 国籍：文莱人、中国人、英国人。": "Country + 人 = nationality: 文莱人 Bruneian, 中国人 Chinese, 英国人 British.", "漏了“人”，意思变成“我就是文莱这个国家”。": "Without 人 the sentence means \"I am the country Brunei\" — always add 人 for nationality.", "有“哪”的问句不加“吗”。": "A question with 哪 (which) already asks something, so don't add 吗.", "哪 nǎ（which，有口字旁） ≠ 那 nà（that）。": "哪 nǎ means \"which\" (it has the mouth radical 口 and a 3rd tone); 那 nà means \"that\" (no 口, 4th tone).", "“一点儿”在动词后、语言前。": "一点儿 (a little) goes after the verb and before the language: 我会说一点儿汉语.", "初学阶段，“会”后面加动词“说”。": "At beginner level, put the verb 说 after 会: 我会说英语 (\"I can speak English\").", "“-语”多指口头说的，“-文”多指书面写的：英语 / 英文，马来语 / 马来文。": "Words ending in -语 usually mean the spoken language, -文 the written language: 英语 / 英文, 马来语 / 马来文.", "表格上的日期用“日”：八月十五日（口语才说“号”）。": "On forms, write dates with 日: 八月十五日. In speech people say 号.", "年龄栏只写“二十一岁”，不写“是”。": "In the age box, just write 二十一岁 — no 是.", "地址由大到小填写。": "Fill in the address from big to small (country first).", "文莱特色：去水村 (Kampong Ayer) 或淡布隆，可以坐船。": "In Brunei you can take a boat (water taxi) to Kampong Ayer or Temburong.", "坐 + 巴士 / 飞机 / 船　·　开 + 车　·　骑 + 自行车 / 摩托车": "Verb + vehicle: 坐 (sit/ride in) bus, plane, boat · 开 (drive) a car · 骑 (ride, astride) a bicycle or motorbike.", "语序：谁 + 什么时候 + 怎么去 + 去 / 来 + 哪儿": "Word order: who + when + how + 去/来 + where: 我每天坐巴士来大学.", "时间词“每天”放在动词前面。": "Time words like 每天 (every day) go before the verb, not at the end.", "在文莱，黄色是王室的颜色。": "In Brunei, yellow is the royal colour.", "帽子、眼镜用“戴”，衣服、裤子用“穿”。": "Use 戴 for things you put on like hats and glasses; use 穿 for clothes and trousers.", "件：衬衫、衣服　·　条：裤子、裙子": "Measure words: 件 for shirts and tops · 条 for trousers and skirts (long, narrow things).", "开斋节等正式场合，大家常穿传统服装。": "On formal occasions such as Hari Raya, people often wear traditional clothes.", "杯：茶、咖啡、水　·　碗：米饭、面": "Measure words: 杯 (cup) for tea, coffee and water · 碗 (bowl) for rice and noodles.", "j、q、x 后的 u 都读 ü，只是省略了两点。": "After j, q and x, u is pronounced ü — the dots are just left out.", "“不”在四声前变二声：bú shì。": "不 changes to 2nd tone before a 4th tone: bú shì.", "“也”在动词“是”前面。": "也 goes right before the verb 是.", "“有”的否定是“没有”。": "The negative of 有 is 没有.", "两个三声相连，前一个变二声。": "When two 3rd tones are together, the first becomes a 2nd tone.", "先撇后捺。": "Left-falling stroke first, then right-falling.", "先进人，后关门。": "Let people in first, then close the door: fill the inside, then seal the bottom.", "国家 + 人 = 国籍。": "Country + 人 = nationality.", "在 + 地方 + 工作。": "在 + place + 工作 (work).", "姓在前，名在后。": "Surname first, given name after.", "年份一个数字一个数字读。": "Read years digit by digit: 二〇〇五年.", "年龄不用“是”。": "No 是 with age.", "有 a 标 a：hǎo。": "If there's an a, the tone mark goes on it: hǎo.", "有“什么”就不加“吗”。": "With 什么 in the question, don't add 吗.", "由大到小。": "From big to small: year → month → day."};
